- Added root `compose.yaml` with a pinned `temporalio/temporal:1.7.2` development-service container, localhost-only gRPC/UI port publishing, a persistent named SQLite volume, Docker health checking, graceful stop behavior, and `restart: unless-stopped` recovery.
